  "title": "Donegal Group Inc. Announces Release Date for First Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "MARIETTA, Pa., April 06, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Donegal Group Inc. (NASDAQ:DGICA) and (NASDAQ:DGICB) announced today that it plans to release its results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026, on Thursday, April 30, 2026, before the opening of regular trading on the NASDAQ Stock Market.",
